  "body": "Still searching for your first home? What if you could have modern living, a great East Auckland location and even stunning views — without having to compromise on the things that matter?\r\n\r\nAt 54 Marendellas Drive, four beautifully finished, brand-new homes are ready for their new owners. From stylish kitchens and light-filled living spaces to private outdoor areas and selected homes offering views towards the Sky Tower and Rangitoto Island, there's plenty here to get excited about.\r\n\r\nAnd here's what makes this opportunity even more appealing: the vendors are highly motivated to meet the market and are ready to consider genuine offers!\r\n\r\nFour Homes – More Choice, More Possibilities!\r\n\r\nEach home offers something different, with features including:\r\n• 3 or 4 bedrooms with practical layouts to suit different family needs.\r\n• 2 to 3 bathrooms, featuring contemporary vanities, tiled showers and illuminated mirrors.\r\n• Modern kitchens with sleek cabinetry, stylish benchtops, quality appliances and excellent storage.\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining, creating a welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n• Heat-pump air conditioning for year-round comfort.\r\n• Practical wardrobe storage, including fitted shelving and drawers in selected layouts.\r\n• Private outdoor spaces, with timber decking and easy-care landscaped gardens.\r\n• Balcony options and elevated outlooks, with selected homes enjoying views towards Auckland's Sky Tower and Rangitoto Island.\r\n• Modern exterior designs, with attractive street appeal and convenient parking arrangements.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the comfort of a brand-new home, with fresh modern finishes and outdoor space to make your own.\r\n\r\nThe Best of East Auckland at Your Doorstep\r\nLocation is another reason these homes are worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the everyday convenience of nearby Highland Park Shopping Centre, supermarkets, local cafés and restaurants. Howick Village offers boutique shopping, weekend markets and a welcoming community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nFor those who love the outdoors, Lloyd Elsmore Park, Marendellas Park, Eastern Beach and Bucklands Beach offer plenty of opportunities for walking, exercise, recreation and family outings.\r\n\r\nHalf Moon Bay Marina is also within easy reach, offering waterfront dining and ferry connections.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the local education options, with the property in zone for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nIt's a well-established East Auckland neighbourhood where everyday convenience meets a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendors – Don't Miss Your Opportunity!\r\nFour brand-new homes. Different layouts. One motivated vendor ready to sell.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are serious about meeting the market, and genuine buyers are encouraged to come forward.\r\n\r\nWhy settle for someone else's old home when you could enjoy the comfort, style and convenience of a brand-new one?\r\n\r\nCome and explore the four options, compare the layouts and discover which home feels right for you.\r\n\r\nDon't wait until your favourite one is gone! Your first home could be closer than you think!\r\n\r\nContact us for more property information or to arrange a private viewing.",
